    <string name="privacy_text">Hindukush Keyboard is a fully offline keyboard.\n\n
• This app has no INTERNET permission, so what you type can never be sent
off your device.\n
• Everything you type, the learned words, the shortcuts and the clipboard history are
stored only in your phone\'s memory and only you have access to them.\n
• This app collects no personal data, shares none and sells none.\n
• It contains no advertising or analytics code whatsoever.\n
• In password fields, suggestions, learning and clipboard capture are disabled automatically.\n\n
Contact: Voice Of Hindukush — hindukushen.com</string>
